   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Atlantic Bank Tourism Financing Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed transaction consists of unsecured financing to Atlantic Bank Limited (&#x201c;Atlantic Bank&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Bank&#x201d;) denominated in US dollars (&#x201c;US$&#x201d;) for up to US$20 million; to be financed by IDB and IDB Invest (the &#x201c;Project&#x201d;). The Project&#x2019;s objective is to assist Atlantic Bank to improve access to funding for Small and Medium-sized Enterprises (&#x201c;SMEs&#x201d;) mainly in the tourism sector.</narrative>
  </description>
